DejaVu is a family of clear, free fonts (Sans, Sans Mono, Serif) covering Latin, Greek,
Cyrillic and many symbols. It gives fontconfig and foot a default monospace font.
Installs the TrueType files in /usr/local/share/fonts/dejavu.
